Section 24 **defines no term** and **cites no external (prior-work) result**; every
citation in it (1.2, 1.3, 13.5, 13.6, 13.7, 15.2, 17.1, 23.5, 24.2–24.7) is
internal to the paper.  The §17 notions *reflection of a triangle* and *catch a
